<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The priest Patricio Sanchez was killed when a large crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass at Our Lady of Perpetual Help in Guayaquil. U.S. forces are now operating alongside Ecuadorian troops, redeploying MQ-9 Reaper drones from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador and conducting anti-drug strikes at sea that seize crews and destroy boats. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation produced 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust, and nightly curfews were imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOS1ZqalVxR2hLZGttSWxaSmtVbmFxLVNONFBzOF9PbV84dlJERHJBZ3NZTVBtY2phUl9kRm9OMmdiRV9BUnRabm9UeF8xaFpERURTVl9RTkQ1djJ1NHB3WW10cFdLOGZMRjk2cFlFN1FxU0tyT0JOTGxqQXd3blVXbU9jaXFoLW1kT2tfajFwVGJWQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WRIF Rocks Detroit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNMVNHZl9QQzNoTHpfVGFibXVGQnZBZHRCTTk1M2IwRXZTaHZFekZGQVJEOXNFNlI1ZjVTQVFhSEhYc0RQR2l2WjFMX1lMcUFSRi05QjFIR1k2MHR2b1h4ZnVCbndLaGdzaWo4MGFPejFvVkFrdzVoQlFyZ3c2NHVoeXNGZms2V1JBbFNMZEJkZFZDRWtUanZvdlFDZzQwQVZySXlsclVsV0FOM1ZlQWFKUVAzZjVUdGVyTEFIRnFLVU1HSTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Straits Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQbUxCbFlaYUF0MTdjY3F5UGhpREZzWUdHVWNGdGdJSS12VndwVzczX3FUVS1ESmUwZU1iV1Z1YTlCdmQ5T2ZySk1TQUtiX0VrNTNZdk1YTnZtVXU4WloxeWVwNDllNzl4SmE1WGdSSHUzZ0dtVmdydUN6YVpKYXJyY3M4NFpyN1JqSFprUDdQeFBBcGxjaVZWUjlub05LeVF2?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Independent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?